From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 10:15:59 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] crypt32: Use a global name for the semaphore of the root
 store import.

The store is the machine's, and services run in session 0: with a name of each session's own, they
imported it alongside the programs of the user's session.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/dlls/crypt32/rootstore.c b/dlls/crypt32/rootstore.c
index 0e492a02dda..1f8b863e2f6 100644
--- a/dlls/crypt32/rootstore.c
+++ b/dlls/crypt32/rootstore.c
@@ -762,7 +762,8 @@ void CRYPT_ImportSystemRootCertsToReg(void)
     if (root_certs_imported)
         return;
 
-    hsem = CreateSemaphoreW( NULL, 0, 1, L"crypt32_root_semaphore");
+    /* a global one: the store is the machine's, and services run in another session */
+    hsem = CreateSemaphoreW( NULL, 0, 1, L"Global\\crypt32_root_semaphore");
     if (!hsem)
     {
         ERR("Failed to create semaphore\n");
